{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RED RIDING HOOD IS NOT THE SAME ANYMORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she wields a shotgun and explosive pies to find her father, the legendary werewolf hunter who vanished without a trace in the deep forest. On her path, she will encounter gangster pigeons, smuggler beavers, heavily armed bandits, and werewolves hiding somewhere in the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath absurd humor and a bright fairy tale lies a dark story of betrayal, fear, and choices one must make when there is nothing left to lose. Belief in fairy tales ends quickly, and ammo runs out even faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE NIGHTMARE OF THE FOREST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/9a02aa9b81ca77a4f339d86f070bee6e.poster.avif?t=1758718328\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/9a02aa9b81ca77a4f339d86f070bee6e.webm?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/9a02aa9b81ca77a4f339d86f070bee6e.mp4?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate hordes of enemies and face dangerous bosses. Use your shotgun, explosive pies, and other abilities to carve your way through the thicket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERCOME OBSTACLE COURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.poster.avif?t=1758718328\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.webm?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.mp4?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivers, swamps, impassable thickets, and steep cliffs will stand in your way. Jump, avoid traps, and clear your path with explosives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE FAIRYTALE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.poster.avif?t=1758718328\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.webm?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.mp4?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of fairy tales where nothing is what it seems and familiar characters take on new forms. Discover hidden paths, loot chests, and uncover all the mysteries of the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new reimagining of familiar fairytale characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark narrative hidden beneath a cheerful story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique cartoonish visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934000?t=1758718328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3