aragraph\" >Exterminate hordes of enemies and face dangerous bosses. Use your shotgun, explosive pies, and other abilities to carve your way through the thicket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERCOME OBSTACLE COURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.poster.avif?t=1758718328\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.webm?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/50c69f33148c9df90c740f98b4066d33.mp4?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivers, swamps, impassable thickets, and steep cliffs will stand in your way. Jump, avoid traps, and clear your path with explosives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE FAIRYTALE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.poster.avif?t=1758718328\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.webm?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/extras/2ee1305b48821618111b0e487408b9c7.mp4?t=1758718328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of fairy tales where nothing is what it seems and familiar characters take on new forms. Discover hidden paths, loot chests, and uncover all the mysteries of the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new reimagining of familiar fairytale characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark narrative hidden beneath a cheerful story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique cartoonish visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Norllina Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934000/d0b38d1e2f2b86621001f34f450bc331eb532e3f/header.jpg?t=1758718328","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Multitales: Hood, Gun & Contraband","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 @ 3.1 GHz or AMD FX-6300 @ 3.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 670 or analogue with 2GB VRAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 (6 core with 3,5 GHz) or Intel i5-10400F (6 core with 2,9 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX580 (8GB) or Nvidia GTX 1660 (6GB)</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Norllina Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"c